1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,097
If you light a signal fire, you also light a dinner bell.

2
00:00:04,210 --> 00:00:08,813
The Signal. Part three of four. Three fires.

3
00:00:09,413 --> 00:00:12,983
Three fires in a triangle. The international sign for help.

4
00:00:13,283 --> 00:00:15,039
And smoke the dead can smell.

5
00:00:15,713 --> 00:00:23,038
Three of anything means help. Three fires. Three whistles. Three flashes.

6
00:00:23,638 --> 00:00:26,203
Light them on the wall. Loud and proud.

7
00:00:26,503 --> 00:00:29,701
Light them far from the village. On the ridge.

8
00:00:30,301 --> 00:00:35,940
Light them on the ridge. The dead walk there. The village stays safe.

9
00:00:36,540 --> 00:00:37,553
I light them at sunset?

10
00:00:37,853 --> 00:00:39,797
At dusk. Then run.

11
00:00:41,040 --> 00:00:45,577
One fire. Two fires. Three fires.

12
00:00:46,177 --> 00:00:52,306
Smoke rises. The dead stir. And far away, an engine starts.

13
00:00:52,906 --> 00:00:58,150
Part three of four, The Signal. Next: the reply.
